Subject: [PATCH] mediatek: integrate GL-MT3600BE network and board fixes

Source: https://github.com/plcharriere/gl-mt3600be-openwrt/tree/92b668321f968b3bfe3b6a1de23317fe0f3f52ad
Author: Paul-Louis Charriere and the authors credited in that tree.

Adapt board defaults and userspace integration to OpenWrt 25.12.6.
Keep the existing RTL8221B EEE workaround and local firmware settings.

